# Combat steps (docs/flow.md, "Combat"; docs/m6-plan.md M6.4a): each step of the round is a window
# between the two combatants' Methuselahs, the acting minion's first; doing something hands the
# impulse to the other; two passes in a row move on. Moves name the card they come from: a card in
# the hand is played with them, a card in play is only named. Card timing isn't checked.
# Seating A B C: A's prey is B, its predator C. Iron Ward stands in for a weapon, Quick Feed for a
# combat card.
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A "Vera Nightfall" *12
library A "Iron Ward" *40
crypt B "Tomas Grey" *12
library B "Quick Feed" *40
crypt C "Ilse Várga" *12
library C "Signal Fire" *40
start

A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> play "Iron Ward" on A:ready:1
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# A hunt, blocked by B: combat starts before range is determined, at close range.
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
expect action hunt A combat
expect combat 1 before-range close
expect window combat minion
expect impulse A
expect waiting A:combat
log public Tomas Grey blocks: combat
reject:not-now A> maneuver long
reject:not-now C> pass
reject:forbidden C> endcombat
A> pass
log public Round 1 · Before range: A passed
expect impulse B
B> pass

# Range: each maneuver hands the impulse to the other side.
expect combat 1 range close
A> maneuver long via A:ready:2
log public Round 1 · Range: Vera Nightfall maneuvers to long using Iron Ward
expect combat 1 range long
expect impulse B
reject:no-change B> maneuver long
B> maneuver close via "Quick Feed"
log public Round 1 · Range: Tomas Grey plays Quick Feed to maneuver to close
expect count B:hand 7
expect count B:ashHeap 1
expect impulse A
A> pass
B> pass

# Before strikes: using a card in play, logged with the step.
expect combat 1 before-strikes close
A> use A:ready:2 "+1 strength"
log public Round 1 · Before strikes: Vera Nightfall uses Iron Ward: +1 strength
expect impulse B
B> pass
A> pass

# Strikes: the acting minion announces first; announcing is the striker's pass.
expect combat 1 strikes close
reject:not-now A> pass
reject:not-now B> strike hand
A> strike 2R via A:ready:2
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Vera Nightfall strikes with Iron Ward: 2R damage
expect impulse B
expect waiting B:combat
B> strike hand
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Tomas Grey strikes: a hand strike for 1

# Damage, press and end of round are plain windows for now; A passes to the end of the round.
expect combat 1 damage close
expect impulse A
A> pass round
log public Round 1 · Damage: A passes until the end of the round
expect impulse B
B> pass
expect combat 1 press close
expect impulse B
B> pass
expect combat 1 end-of-round close
B> pass
expect action none
expect combat none
expect window none
log public Combat is over; the action was blocked

# Standing passes: B passes to the strikes, but A maneuvering drops it, so B can answer.
A> unlock A:ready:1
B> unlock B:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
B> pass strikes
expect impulse A
A> pass
expect combat 1 range close
expect impulse A
A> maneuver long
expect impulse B
B> pass
A> pass
expect combat 1 before-strikes long
A> pass strikes
expect impulse B
B> pass strikes
expect combat 1 strikes long
expect impulse A
A> strike none
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Vera Nightfall doesn't strike
B> strike dodge via B:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Tomas Grey plays Quick Feed to strike: dodge
expect combat 1 damage long
B> endcombat
expect action none

# An action that enters combat: Vera fights Ilse, and only A and C are in it.
A> unlock A:ready:1
A> action A:ready:1
B> pass
C> pass
expect action other A resolution
A> resolve combat C:ready:1
log public Vera Nightfall enters combat with Ilse Várga
expect action other A combat
expect combat 1 before-range close
expect waiting A:combat
reject:not-now B> pass
reject:forbidden B> endcombat
A> pass
expect impulse C
C> endcombat
log public The action succeeded
expect action none

# Others aren't in the combat windows: they can't play cards there. A judge passing for a
# combatant who hasn't struck yet means no strike.
A> unlock A:ready:1
B> unlock B:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
reject:not-now C> play C:hand:1
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes
expect combat 1 strikes close
A> strike hand 2
B> call slow-play
judge> rule passfor B
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Tomas Grey doesn't strike
expect combat 1 damage close
A> endcombat
expect action none

# Using a card in play works outside combat too; in a window it needs the impulse.
A> use A:ready:2 "Prepares for the next fight"
log public Vera Nightfall uses Iron Ward: Prepares for the next fight
